  "decisions": [
    "One external package, no gameplay bank in ROM. Full RAW/provenance and typed derivatives preserve both original languages.",
    "Streaming catalog and reads, no whole package residency. Stable IDs, exact aliases, immutable session, caller-owned candidate/backing/cache pins and generation.",
    "A failed unpublished candidate can change; old published backing, metadata and output lease are preserved.",
    "RAW is verify-only. Generic reader validates integrity/schema; converter/oracle pin original archives.",
    "Ru world selection/profile remains N05. GPU material/UV/LIGHT remain N06/N07/N13."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "Physical DS/DS Lite, flashcart/loader/microSD, FPS and latency deferred to N24.",
    "No original EXE analysis or new DOS execution in N04; resource conversion verified against immutable original RES.",
    "No complete gameplay world, renderer, scheduler, PCM playback, full-game working-set peak or game saves.",
    "Platform stdio adapter uses positive 32-bit LONG, limiting file size to less than 2 GiB; wire offsets are u32.",
    "Synthetic palette controls test errors, not original gameplay equivalence."
  ]
